@startuml
title Swimlane Activity Diagram - Responsibility Handoffs across System Roles
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false

|#LightYellow|Passenger|
|#LightCyan|Railway Reservation System|
|#LightGreen|Payment Simulator|
|#Lavender|Administrator|

|Passenger|
start
:Submit Search (Source, Dest, Date);

|Railway Reservation System|
:Validate Station Selection & Date;
:Execute Route Ordering Algorithm;
:Retrieve Real-Time Fares & Seat Inventory;
:Render Matching Train Cards;

|Passenger|
:Select Train & Travel Class;
:Enter Passenger & Contact Information;
:Submit Booking Request;

|Railway Reservation System|
:Validate Passenger Names, Ages, Contact;
:Calculate Fare Breakdown (Base + Surcharges);
:Begin Serializable Transaction (BEGIN IMMEDIATE);
:Recheck Live Inventory Quotas;
if (Inventory Status?) then (Available CNF)
  :Reserve Temporary Seat Slot;
else (WL Available)
  :Reserve Temporary WL Slot;
else (Full / Regret)
  :Abort Transaction;
  |Passenger|
  :Display "Train Fully Booked";
  stop
endif

|Railway Reservation System|
:Generate Payment Request Token;
:Open Simulated Payment Interface;

|Payment Simulator|
:Present Payment Options (Card/UPI);\nWait for User Interaction;

|Passenger|
:Select Payment Outcome\n(Success, Failure, or Cancel);

|Payment Simulator|
if (Selected Outcome?) then (Success)
  :Generate Simulation Transaction ID;
  :Send Payment Authorized Callback;
else (Failure / Decline)
  :Send Payment Declined Callback;
  |Railway Reservation System|
  :Rollback Temporary Seat Reservation;
  :Record Failed Payment Audit;
  |Passenger|
  :Display "Payment Failed - Inventory Released";
  stop
endif

|Railway Reservation System|
:Commit Database Transaction;
if (Booking Type?) then (Confirmed)
  :Deduct Seat from Available Inventory;
  :Assign Coach & Berth Identifiers;
else (Waiting List)
  :Increment Waiting List Count;
  :Assign Sequential WL Position;
endif
:Generate Unique 10-char PNR;
:Create Booking & Passenger Records;
:Issue Digital E-Ticket with Watermark;

|Passenger|
:View / Print Demonstration E-Ticket;

== Later Lifecycle: Cancellation Workflow ==

|Passenger|
:Request Ticket Cancellation (Enter PNR);

|Railway Reservation System|
:Verify PNR & Check Cancellation Eligibility;
:Calculate Refund Tier based on Hours to Departure;
:Display Net Refund & Deduction Breakdown;

|Passenger|
:Confirm Cancellation;

|Railway Reservation System|
:Execute Atomic Cancellation Transaction;
:Mark Booking as CANCELLED;
if (Was Confirmed Ticket?) then (yes)
  :Return Seat to Available Pool;
  if (Any Queued WL Passengers?) then (yes)
    :Promote First WL Passenger to CNF;
    :Assign Freed Seat to Promoted Passenger;
    :Renumber Remaining WL Positions;
    :Log WL Promotion Event;
  endif
else (Waiting List Ticket)
  :Decrement Waiting List Counter;
endif
:Initiate Refund Request;

|Payment Simulator|
:Process Simulated Refund Credit;
:Return Refund Reference ID;

|Railway Reservation System|
:Record Refund Record & Update Audit Trail;

|Passenger|
:Receive Cancellation & Refund Confirmation;

== Administrative Oversight ==

|Administrator|
:Log In with Admin Credentials;

|Railway Reservation System|
:Validate Admin Token / Credentials;
:Load Real-time Analytics Dashboard;

|Administrator|
:Review Revenue, Occupancy, & WL Queues;
:Adjust Seat Quotas or Add Schedules;

|Railway Reservation System|
:Apply Modifications with Instant Effect;
:Write Security Audit Log;

|Administrator|
stop

@enduml
